  "description": "First-generation engaged audio path after the General Guitar Gadgets original-style redraw, 2012-01-30. Red LED clipping and stock normalled effects loop. The generic red LED card is a representative fit. The op-amps use 1.5 V nominal headroom from both ends of the 9 V supply.",
